{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15303260","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15303260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1530326001:1":{"text":"둘러보세요. 뭐든 다 있으니, 필요한 물건을 찾으실 수 있을 거예요!","source_cn":"随便看，我这里什么都有，所有你需要的我这都有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA89D0B2C5D407932","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1530326002:1":{"text":"음... 확실히 물건은 괜찮은데, 정말 뭐든 다 있는 건가요?","source_cn":"嗯……你这的确实都不错，不过你这真的什么都有吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0E1926D17F14A81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1530326003:1":{"text":"당연하죠! 이런 것뿐만 아니라, 옷이며 배를 채울 수 있는 것까지 다 가지고 있어요!","source_cn":"当然！不止是这些用的，穿的……或者填饱肚子的，我这都有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x447916D4DEE63EA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1530326004:1":{"text":"관심이 있으시면 자세히 이야기를 나눠보시죠!","source_cn":"感兴趣的话，我们可以详聊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEFF7EF7D2065EA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人阿伦":{"text":"상인 앨런","source":"商人阿伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:累马尔":{"text":"레이말","source":"累马尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}